--- DEMO 3: Exact Heat Kernel (algebraic) ---

Heat kernel K(ln(q)) for the 5-item tournament:
  K(ln(q)) is a Laurent polynomial in u = q^(1/10)

  K(ln( 2)) = 5.4497474683  (exact: polynomial in 2^(1/10))
  K(ln( 3)) = 6.1068360252  (exact: polynomial in 3^(1/10))
  K(ln( 7)) = 8.4580755491  (exact: polynomial in 7^(1/10))
  K(ln(42)) = 19.6203349690  (exact: polynomial in 42^(1/10))


